{"zip(error_ids, events.values()) is unsafe because nodestore.backend.get_multi returns a dictionary that may not preserve input key order and only contains entries for found nodes, causing misalignment of error_ids with wrong data when events are missing": 0.968903124332428, "Validation logic uses .get(\"timestamp\") which fails when timestamp is 0 - should use \"timestamp\" in self.initial_data to correctly detect field presence": 0.9223421812057495, "Unit mismatch in timestamp comparison: Sentry error timestamps are in seconds while RRWeb events use milliseconds, causing incorrect chronological interleaving where all errors are yielded before any breadcrumbs": 0.9602647423744202}